Near:   audio  - duration within 2 % and loudness-envelope correlation >= 0.96 (same sound, other encode)
        video  - duration within 2 % and 3 frame dHashes within 6 bits (same clip, other export)
        image  - dHash within 4 bits and same aspect (same picture, other size/format)
